{"schema_version": "1", "chunk_id": "chunk_109df3527ae083f0f3caa2330bfaff95", "text": "文档：附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf\n原文：4.1.7地块污水接出口晴天COD浓度评价总分值为20分。 1所有污水接出口晴天COD浓度不小于250mg/L，不扣分； 2污水接出口晴天COD浓度在150mg/L（含）-250mg/L之间，存在一处，扣5分，最多扣10分： 3污水接出口晴天COD浓度在100mg/L（含）-150mg/L之间，存在一处，扣10分，最多扣20分： 4污水接出口晴天COD浓度低于100mg/L，存在一处，扣20分。", "evidence_ids": ["ev_5d82c43971f55ef615f7e5a9c0fca07d"], "primary_evidence_id": "ev_5d82c43971f55ef615f7e5a9c0fca07d", "document_version_id": "doc_4336797dedd12e80", "evidence_type": "clause", "physical_pages": [19], "metadata": {"standard_number": "", "document_kind": "policy", "jurisdiction": "重庆", "effective_status": "current", "file_name": "附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf", "source_uri": "", "heading_path": [], "context_scope": "page_local_inferred", "quality_status": "approved", "usage_policy": "answer_and_citation", "text_reliability": "quality_gate_approved", "official_source_uri": "https://zfcxjw.cq.gov.cn/zwxx_166/gsgg/202512/P020251219628365527259.pdf", "source_authority": "重庆市住房和城乡建设委员会", "source_review": "official_fulltext_verified", "publication_date": "2025-12-08", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": "9999-12-31", "local_file_match": "sha256_match", "selection_status": "approved_formal"}}
{"schema_version": "1", "chunk_id": "chunk_c0c2d30ce27110fd3fe6e1bcae6c6d6f", "text": "文档：附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf\n标题路径：4.2.1地块改造前后水质浓度提升率M评价总分值为5分。\n原文：1分流改造后污水接出口雨天COD浓度提升率在10%（含）-20%之间，得2分； 2分流改造后污水接出口雨天COD浓度提升率在20%（含）-30%之间.得4分 3分流改造后污水接出口雨天COD浓度提升率30%（含）及以上，得5分。", "evidence_ids": ["ev_691e6fe464c493260085e148f466e010"], "primary_evidence_id": "ev_691e6fe464c493260085e148f466e010", "document_version_id": "doc_4336797dedd12e80", "evidence_type": "paragraph", "physical_pages": [19], "metadata": {"standard_number": "", "document_kind": "policy", "jurisdiction": "重庆", "effective_status": "current", "file_name": "附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf", "source_uri": "", "heading_path": ["4.2.1地块改造前后水质浓度提升率M评价总分值为5分。"], "context_scope": "page_local_inferred", "quality_status": "approved", "usage_policy": "answer_and_citation", "text_reliability": "quality_gate_approved", "official_source_uri": "https://zfcxjw.cq.gov.cn/zwxx_166/gsgg/202512/P020251219628365527259.pdf", "source_authority": "重庆市住房和城乡建设委员会", "source_review": "official_fulltext_verified", "publication_date": "2025-12-08", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": "9999-12-31", "local_file_match": "sha256_match", "selection_status": "approved_formal"}}
{"schema_version": "1", "chunk_id": "chunk_fea9f12ac4c36b7535662dab0d45ca7d", "text": "文档：附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf\n标题路径：4.2.2排水设施运行维护管理评价总分值为5分。\n原文：1建立排水设施长效运维管理制度，明确了排水设施运维主体和管护单位、落实运维资金保障、建立完善的运行管理和安全管理制度，满足一项，得1分，最多得3分： 2配备了专业运维人员、设施设备，满足一项，得1分，最多得2分。", "evidence_ids": ["ev_debba238a23e55a3354b26b14dda17d9"], "primary_evidence_id": "ev_debba238a23e55a3354b26b14dda17d9", "document_version_id": "doc_4336797dedd12e80", "evidence_type": "paragraph", "physical_pages": [19], "metadata": {"standard_number": "", "document_kind": "policy", "jurisdiction": "重庆", "effective_status": "current", "file_name": "附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf", "source_uri": "", "heading_path": ["4.2.2排水设施运行维护管理评价总分值为5分。"], "context_scope": "page_local_inferred", "quality_status": "approved", "usage_policy": "answer_and_citation", "text_reliability": "quality_gate_approved", "official_source_uri": "https://zfcxjw.cq.gov.cn/zwxx_166/gsgg/202512/P020251219628365527259.pdf", "source_authority": "重庆市住房和城乡建设委员会", "source_review": "official_fulltext_verified", "publication_date": "2025-12-08", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": "9999-12-31", "local_file_match": "sha256_match", "selection_status": "approved_formal"}}
{"schema_version": "1", "chunk_id": "chunk_8b0308f84c284b0550773ba4e022d0ea", "text": "文档：附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf\n标题路径：6.1评分项\n原文：6.1.1排水分区项目在雨污分流改造方案论证时，应明确排水管网改造原则，合理采用管渠设计重现期等设计参数，选用全生命周期经济适用技术先进的管材，对于暂无法完全分流的区域应采用合理的截流、快速处理等污染控制措施。", "evidence_ids": ["ev_434b5f99d10ae79f2559e87b894b2b0d"], "primary_evidence_id": "ev_434b5f99d10ae79f2559e87b894b2b0d", "document_version_id": "doc_4336797dedd12e80", "evidence_type": "clause", "physical_pages": [38], "metadata": {"standard_number": "", "document_kind": "policy", "jurisdiction": "重庆", "effective_status": "current", "file_name": "附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf", "source_uri": "", "heading_path": ["6.1评分项"], "context_scope": "page_local_inferred", "quality_status": "approved", "usage_policy": "answer_and_citation", "text_reliability": "quality_gate_approved", "official_source_uri": "https://zfcxjw.cq.gov.cn/zwxx_166/gsgg/202512/P020251219628365527259.pdf", "source_authority": "重庆市住房和城乡建设委员会", "source_review": "official_fulltext_verified", "publication_date": "2025-12-08", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": "9999-12-31", "local_file_match": "sha256_match", "selection_status": "approved_formal"}}
{"schema_version": "1", "chunk_id": "chunk_38f954a2626650049588b6c2165f3932", "text": "文档：附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf\n标题路径：6.1评分项\n原文：6.1.7根据《城市排水工程规划规范》GB50318第6.5.2条的相关规定，合流制排水系统的溢流污水，可采用调蓄后就地处理或送至污水厂处理等方式，处理达标后利用或排放。就地处理应结合空间条件选择旋流分离、人工湿地等处理措施。第6.5.3条规定，合流制排水系统调蓄设施宜结合泵站设置，在系统中段或末端布置，应根据用地条件、管网布局、污水处理厂位置和环境要求等因素综合确定。通过本指标的设置，推动科学合理设置溢流污染控制措施，并重点关注溢流污染控制效果，如改造后溢流频次、溢流时长、溢流负荷等变化情况。", "evidence_ids": ["ev_e6cbd6cbe24c0c9fe3a692615afb8186"], "primary_evidence_id": "ev_e6cbd6cbe24c0c9fe3a692615afb8186", "document_version_id": "doc_4336797dedd12e80", "evidence_type": "clause", "physical_pages": [38], "metadata": {"standard_number": "", "document_kind": "policy", "jurisdiction": "重庆", "effective_status": "current", "file_name": "附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf", "source_uri": "", "heading_path": ["6.1评分项"], "context_scope": "page_local_inferred", "quality_status": "approved", "usage_policy": "answer_and_citation", "text_reliability": "quality_gate_approved", "official_source_uri": "https://zfcxjw.cq.gov.cn/zwxx_166/gsgg/202512/P020251219628365527259.pdf", "source_authority": "重庆市住房和城乡建设委员会", "source_review": "official_fulltext_verified", "publication_date": "2025-12-08", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": "9999-12-31", "local_file_match": "sha256_match", "selection_status": "approved_formal"}}
{"schema_version": "1", "chunk_id": "chunk_8e58eb622873dbe3f91ed15a339e903b", "text": "文档：附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf\n标题路径：6.2加分项\n原文：6.2.1依托水质或水量监测设备，采取人工、在线监测等手段进行常态化监测，可完成排水管网的关键点位排查摸底和数据更新，实现动态管理，为厘清外水入渗、溢流等问题建立管控依据。", "evidence_ids": ["ev_6de4def06fa0cc2273e5fc2b5761ff79"], "primary_evidence_id": "ev_6de4def06fa0cc2273e5fc2b5761ff79", "document_version_id": "doc_4336797dedd12e80", "evidence_type": "clause", "physical_pages": [38], "metadata": {"standard_number": "", "document_kind": "policy", "jurisdiction": "重庆", "effective_status": "current", "file_name": "附件：重庆市城市排水管网雨污分流效果评价技术导则（试行）.pdf", "source_uri": "", "heading_path": ["6.2加分项"], "context_scope": "page_local_inferred", "quality_status": "approved", "usage_policy": "answer_and_citation", "text_reliability": "quality_gate_approved", "official_source_uri": "https://zfcxjw.cq.gov.cn/zwxx_166/gsgg/202512/P020251219628365527259.pdf", "source_authority": "重庆市住房和城乡建设委员会", "source_review": "official_fulltext_verified", "publication_date": "2025-12-08", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": "9999-12-31", "local_file_match": "sha256_match", "selection_status": "approved_formal"}}
